[agent] 1. **Feature group `cctxn4b8521` (v1)** — 24,058 labelled transactions with 34 engineered features (all point-in-time correct, computed from past rows only): per-card transaction velocity (time since previous txn, counts in 1h/24h windows), geo signals (haversine distance from the card's historical mean location, distance from previous transaction, implied travel speed), amount signals (expanding per-card mean/std/max, z-score, ratios), hour/day cyclical features, per-card prior fraud history, category one-hots, and merchant frequency.
[agent] 2. **Training dataset `cctd4b8521`** — a feature view over the feature group with `is_fraud` as label, materialized as training dataset version 1 via the Feature Query Service.
